<title>USA: R.R. Donnelley &amp; Sons Co Q3 net off.</title>
<headline>R.R. Donnelley &amp; Sons Co Q3 net off.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.45		    $0.60</p>
<p> Net			 67,868		   92,057</p>
<p> Revs		   1,602,528		1,704,793</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 152,444		  153,629</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.66   profit	 $1.33</p>
<p> Net loss		 254,774   profit     203,360</p>
<p> Revs		   4,727,024		4,513,515</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 153,416		  153,408</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 9-mos earnings are after one-time restructuring charge of $560 million pre-tax in the first half, and one-time gain of $44 million pre-tax on initial public offering of Metromail Corp in second quarter. Excluding these items, 1996 9-mos net was $154 million, or $1.01 per share.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
